Z||000008||Archie||08-25-2001||08:08 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MinnGreenGT:<BR><B>Army of one? Didn't that have Dolph Lundgren and a replica Ferrari F40?  It was in the desert...<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually there were 2 F-40's in that movie. Rent that movie again & look real close. The 2 F-40 bodies they used were bodies I supplied. The one that get crushed at the end, was just the fiberglass body attached to a wood frame. When the beam lands on top of it, notice how it just pancakes out.<P>This is a real lousy movie. IMHO it is not worth renting it just for the cars, because that part is bad too.<P>Archie  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
